    "note": "Reengrossed version (04/14/2024). The bill has a House passage vote; amendments made after the version read (Senate) are not in the text read. The text file scrambles the opening of 18-12-603(1) (\"EXCEPT AS OTHERWISE PROVIDED IN SUBSECTIONS (2) AND (3) OF THIS SECTION,\" appears out of order), so only the main clause is quoted. The $250,000 / $500,000 penalties named in the bill summary were not found in the section text read; the section text read has a $750 civil penalty for private sales. Section 2 lower-case words in 18-12-108.7(3) may be struck; check the page image. In the text file, the end of 18-12-605 is scrambled (\"WEAPON, PROVIDED THAT THE ASSAULT WEAPON IS\" appears after the citation); the quote gives it in reading order."
